abstract: >-
  We prove that a clique blow-up of the five-cycle is biplanar if and only if it has at most
  sixteen vertices and clique number at most eight. Consequently every biplanar clique blow-up
  of the five-cycle is 8-colourable, which answers Question 7.3 of Trivedi in the negative. The
  non-biplanar cases are refuted by a propositional encoding of biplanarity, strengthened by a
  contraction argument for K9, whose unsatisfiability certificates are checked in Lean 4.
references:
